  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nFree shipping on orders $35+ 🚀\n\nShop\nMeet us\nRecipes\nContact\nCart\nRecipes\nKrapow Shrimp Rice Paper Wraps\nDECEMBER 15, 2021\n\nSpicy, salty and oh-so-flavorful, these shrimp rice paper wraps make the perfect lil' snack.\n\n11 comments\nVeggie Rice Paper Dumplings\nDECEMBER 15, 2021\n\nServe these flavor bombs on their own as an appetizer, or as a meal with your favorite grains!\n\n16 comments\nGround Meat Krapow\nDECEMBER 2, 2021\n\nFire up this beloved Teigen fam recipe for chili basil stir-fry in under 20 minutes.\n\n7 comments\nThai Krapow Fried Rice\nDECEMBER 2, 2021\n\nHearty and aromatic, this classic fried rice will spice up any weeknight dinner.\n\nCrispy Spicy Bulgogi Pork Belly\nDECEMBER 2, 2021\n\nThis spicy pork belly has the perfect amount of crunch. Enjoy over rice or noodles for a satisfying meal.\n\n4 comments\nSpice up your inbox\n\nSign up for our newsletter to get exclusive recipes, cooking tips, and more.\n\nEmail\nQuick links\nShop all\nMeet us\nRecipes\nContact\nOur mission\n\nTo bring proud, loud Asian flavors to your fingertips any day of the week.\n\nTwitter\nFacebook\nPinterest\nInstagram\nTikTok\nCountry/region\nCanada (CAD $)\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-crave-demo Powered by Shopify"
